• High-Priority Plan

  1. Correctness
      - Fix stale smoke test expectations: scripts/smoke_test.sh:29 expects files directly under saved_prompts/<prompt_id>/, but
        agents/prompt_id_coder_agent.py:227 writes into saved_prompts/<prompt_id>/runs/<run_id>/.

      - Standardize prompt chunk content: several readers query chunk_file from BigQuery but only store filenames, not content, e.g.
